    "Los hombres de Knut": "Knut's men", "Piratas del estrecho": "Pirates of the straits", "Señores de la isla": "Lords of the island", "Soldados del emperador": "The emperor's soldiers", "Bandidos del río": "River bandits", "Jefes de Magnus": "Magnus's chieftains", "Reino de Dinamarca": "Kingdom of Denmark", "Señores de las islas": "Lords of the isles", "Los condes del norte": "The northern earls", "Los sajones": "The Saxons", "Reino de Inglaterra": "Kingdom of England",
