    "Guardia de la reina": "The queen's guard", "Ladrones de caballos": "Horse thieves", "Soldados de Sosso": "Soldiers of Sosso", "Aliados de Sumaoro": "Sumaoro's allies", "Herreros de Sosso": "Smiths of Sosso", "Guardia de Sumaoro": "Sumaoro's guard", "Ejército de Sosso": "Army of Sosso", "Reino de Sosso": "Kingdom of Sosso",
    "Los francos": "The Franks", "Emires del delta": "Emirs of the delta", "Flota de Bizancio": "Byzantine fleet", "Emires de Siria": "Emirs of Syria", "Guardia de Alepo": "Aleppo guard", "El rey Balduino": "King Baldwin", "Jinetes de Kerak": "Riders of Kerak", "Guardia de Kerak": "Kerak guard", "Ejército del reino": "The kingdom's army", "Señorío de Kerak": "Lordship of Kerak",
